        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 7037/0, Rectangular Beveled Edge Flush Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Traditional Pocket Door Flush Pull has a beveled edge that grants it a classic feel. This pocket door flush pull comes packaged with the matching installation screws. It has a 1/8 inch projection. Choose from a wide array of finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/traditional-pocket-door-passage-set-omnia-7037-n\"><b>Passage Set</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/traditional-pocket-door-privacy-set-omnia-7037-l\"><b>Privacy Set</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/traditional-pocket-door-keyed-entry-set-omnia-7037-a\"><b>Keyed Entry Function</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Beveled Edge Sliding Door Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-9/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Cut-Out Height: 5-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Cut-Out Width: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Depth: 7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-7037-0-specifications.pdf?v=1704262371\"><b>Omnia 7037 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually:</b> one (1) rectangle flush pull and all mounting hardware. <b>For One Side of (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>",
